{"unit_id":"toustifer__dsh-harvest#card-zh","repo":"toustifer/dsh-harvest","commit":"e642718f4488b6b0a1cc3c6501042cde998ed8e5","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-harvest 是面向 DSH Web 的多平台研究工具插件，在 DSH 中注册五个工具和一个可调用 Skill。它能并行搜索 GitHub、网页及多类社交和视频平台，抓取网页正文并在适用时回退到 Jina Reader，也能处理 RSS 与小宇宙播客；另提供断言交叉验证、来源五维启发式审计和 Tavily 异步深度研究。适合需要从多个渠道收集资料、核验来源并整理研究报告的 DSH 用户。深度研究需要 Tavily API Key；其他通道按需依赖相应本地 CLI、会话或 Python 环境。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:116-161","lib/index.js:185-246","lib/index.js:250-356","lib/backends.js:373-460","lib/extract.js:110-127"]}
{"unit_id":"toustifer__dsh-harvest#card-en","repo":"toustifer/dsh-harvest","commit":"e642718f4488b6b0a1cc3c6501042cde998ed8e5","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-harvest adds five DSH tools and a Skill for research. It searches code, web, social, and video sources, extracts pages with a Jina fallback, compares claims, reviews sources, and retrieves Tavily research reports. Deep research needs a Tavily key; other channels may need local CLIs or sessions.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:116-161","lib/index.js:185-246","lib/index.js:250-356","lib/backends.js:373-460","lib/extract.js:110-127"]}
