{"unit_id":"toustifer__dsh-harvest#feature-1","repo":"toustifer/dsh-harvest","commit":"e642718f4488b6b0a1cc3c6501042cde998ed8e5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-harvest 的功能「多平台发现」：harvest_scout 并行查询 GitHub、网页、社交、视频和社区通道；失败通道记入 skipped。输入主题并可选平台与数量，返回候选标题、URL 和摘要。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:121-161","lib/backends.js:373-460"]}
{"unit_id":"toustifer__dsh-harvest#feature-2","repo":"toustifer/dsh-harvest","commit":"e642718f4488b6b0a1cc3c6501042cde998ed8e5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-harvest 的功能「正文提取」：harvest_extract 接收 URL 列表，普通网页先直抓，网络失败时尝试 Jina Reader；402 标记为付费墙，仍失败则标记不可达。它也能识别 RSS 和小宇宙播客地址。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:164-182","lib/extract.js:62-83","lib/extract.js:85-127"]}
{"unit_id":"toustifer__dsh-harvest#feature-3","repo":"toustifer/dsh-harvest","commit":"e642718f4488b6b0a1cc3c6501042cde998ed8e5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-harvest 的功能「断言交叉验证」：harvest_verify 接收断言和已抓取来源，按关键词命中来源数标记 verified、weak 或 unverified，并返回匹配来源。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:185-212"]}
{"unit_id":"toustifer__dsh-harvest#feature-4","repo":"toustifer/dsh-harvest","commit":"e642718f4488b6b0a1cc3c6501042cde998ed8e5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-harvest 的功能「来源审计」：harvest_audit 根据来源 URL 与类型，对权威性、一手性、可验证性、时效和偏见进行启发式评分，输出 trust、caution 或 discard 判定。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:214-246"]}
{"unit_id":"toustifer__dsh-harvest#feature-5","repo":"toustifer/dsh-harvest","commit":"e642718f4488b6b0a1cc3c6501042cde998ed8e5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-harvest 的功能「异步深度研究」：harvest_deep_research 提交主题或研究提纲到 Tavily research API，轮询任务状态，并返回报告内容、来源、状态和响应时间。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:250-353"]}
{"unit_id":"toustifer__dsh-harvest#feature-6","repo":"toustifer/dsh-harvest","commit":"e642718f4488b6b0a1cc3c6501042cde998ed8e5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-harvest 的功能「研究 Skill 调度」：插件启动时将 harvest Skill 注册到 DSH，提供适用场景和 scout、extract、verify、audit 的流程约定，并允许用户或模型调用。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:402-429","skills/harvest/SKILL.md:7-28"]}
